don't ever need that","start":73.54000091552734},{"end":84.72000122070312,"text":"I don't need to know that there was a chance that maybe you could have seen it in a different clue","start":79.66000366210938},{"end":86.0999984741211,"text":"But you're just afraid","start":84.72000122070312},{"end":94.62000274658203,"text":"Of all the colors that come along with being you","start":88.22000122070312},{"end":101.77999877929688,"text":"Yeah, you're just afraid of what it means","start":97.31999969482422},{"end":107.86000061035156,"text":"To never acknowledge your own hurt","start":104.13999938964844},{"end":110.04000091552734,"text":"Than to anyone else, actually, that you can hurt","start":107.86000061035156},{"end":112.18000030517578,"text":"Of course not, pride, pride is too much for that","start":110.04000091552734},{"end":113.9800033569336,"text":"And you can't do it, and you won't","start":112.18000030517578},{"end":119.26000213623047,"text":"It doesn't mean I have to sit here and be taken","start":116.12000274658203},{"end":122.87999725341797,"text":"Taken for granted by anything that I've done","start":120.26000213623047},{"end":128.1999969482422,"text":"I looked at it like a lollabillity, lollabillity, lollaloopsie, whoops, whoops, whoopsie-doo","start":122.87999725341797},{"end":130.33999633789062,"text":"I ain't arguing over spilled milk","start":128.25999450683594},{"end":136.32000732421875,"text":"Thought you trusted it in turn, and then you didn't, you don't want it, you don't","start":131.13999938964844},{"end":139.5399932861328,"text":"It's hard for you to say, but I'll say it for you","start":136.5800018310547},{"end":141.8000030517578,"text":"It's the sunset when it looks pretty","start":139.5399932861328},{"end":150.6199951171875,"text":"Cause even the end of the thing that you thought was for you, it's obviously not","start":144.16000366210938},{"end":155.83999633789062,"text":"So stop crying over the fact that you've gotta be me","start":151.72000122070312},{"end":160.4600067138672,"text":"And get it over with so I can start","start":157.1999969482422},{"end":162.9199981689453,"text":"Remembering that I didn't want to be gone","start":160.8000030517578},{"end":166.33999633789062,"text":"And I tried my best to hold on","start":163.77999877929688},{"end":170.17999267578125,"text":"And I shouldn't punish myself anymore","start":167.17999267578125},{"end":175.6199951171875,"text":"So, look at that sunset with its red, yellow, blue","start":170.47999572753906},{"end":180.6199951171875,"text":"Look at that view of what to be was something good","start":176.1999969482422},{"end":188.39999389648438,"text":"But as it goes down in time, the society's lines and your own mistakes made it so you can't have me here","start":181.5800018310547},{"end":192.6199951171875,"text":"And you gotta make your own change, and you made that","start":189.5399932861328},{"end":197.94000244140625,"text":"But there's a special place in somewhere or in the places afterwards for people like you","start":193.22000122070312},{"end":203.47999572753906,"text":"What do you do with all the ghosts and all the bodies you fucking hid on your ride home?","start":199.36000061035156},{"end":208.89999389648438,"text":"Cause you could've had the hope of that, but you don't","start":206.25999450683594}],"unlock":{"card":"card-259","fragments":10},"chartVersion":"v6_master","chartReport":{"version":"v6_master","bpm":89.88,"catalogBpm":176,"tempoConfidence":0.76,"beats":316,"bars":78,"repeatedBars":13,"povTimes":[72.551,170.957],"typeCounts":{"tap":344,"hold":12,"accent":10,"swipe":16,"slide":5,"hold-swipe":2},"ms":46}}